yline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "A lot of people are writing results on math with AI. I kinda felt left out, because I even though I could\u2019ve asked it to solve some problem X, I wasn\u2019t sure how it would feel \u2018real\u2019. Or if I could be confident that it would be right, even if it was. Hell, even if it was formalised in LEAN, the formalisation could be wrong because of how complicated LEAN\u2026",
